In order for Fidoficus to become a truly menacing force of destructive power, he needs a strict diet of macro-nutrients. 

We Domanaar have no need for such corporeal sustenance. And therefore, I am not familiar with the process of cooking. 

Take the ingredients you've gathered and create something nourishing. 

And tasty. Not that I'd care. <want to hit beats where the Dom lets slip that it cares for the creature, at least a little> 
